WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:09.141
A drum rack puts one sample on each of sixteen pads. Click its name in the Channel Rack to open it.

2
00:00:09.637 --> 00:00:14.095
Click a pad to hear it. Hats in the same choke group cut each other off.

3
00:00:18.741 --> 00:00:23.106
An instrument rack layers several sounds, with eight macro knobs on top.

4
00:00:25.527 --> 00:00:29.753
Turn a macro while it plays, and every knob mapped to it follows.

5
00:00:36.067 --> 00:00:40.200
Store the positions as a variation, and recall one with a single click.

6
00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:48.001
To build your own, right-click any channel and choose Wrap in rack.
